WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.460 line:8%
<v Anna>Hi, it's Anna from Berger &amp; Co. Could I get half an hour with Mara this week?

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.580 line:8%
<v Hermes>Let me check her calendar.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.750 line:8%
<v Hermes>Wednesday is fully booked.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.350 line:8%
<v Hermes>Thursday, 14:30 instead?

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.000 line:8%
<v Anna>Thursday works.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.210 line:8%
<v Hermes>Booked. You'll get a confirmation.
